{"about_the_game":"Skeletons is a first-person exploration indie game with melee combat, each level is made up of several separate locations which vary each time you play.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Delve Deep, Ascend High.</h2></strong><br>To progress you must explore The Tower over three separate locations, The Grimy Lowers, The Industrial City and The Dark Palace.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Queen and Her Heresies.</h2></strong><br>Demented skeletons roam the halls and dungeons, fight your way through them using your war-hammer, crossbow and an assortment of spells, Live long enough and you might encounter The Queen or her heretical abominations. <br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Starve The Curse.</h2></strong><br>The land is cursed! Merely being here is enough to ruin you, death is inevitable. The curse can be starved off with potions and blessings which will give you back precious minutes. Slaying the demented will also crawl back the hourglass, but if that fails....<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sink or Swim?</h2></strong><br>The world is dark and unwelcoming, Skeletons doesn't hold your hand. You will fail repeatedly but in doing so you will gain the knowledge to make it further next time.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846980/4c26c60036dfeb437dc63d2bbe6140911ccb5994.jpg"},{"name":"Failed Creation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846980/4c26c60036dfeb437dc63d2bbe6140911ccb5994.jpg"},{"name":"Torment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846980/4c26c60036dfeb437dc63d2bbe6140911ccb5994.jpg"},{"name":"Burn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846980/4c26c60036dfeb437dc63d2bbe6140911ccb5994.jpg"},{"name":"Hunt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846980/4c26c60036dfeb437dc63d2bbe6140911